  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{選|えら}ぶ (choose X).\n\nASPECT: ⟦ている→ている：noentry⟧ indicates resulting state or ongoing selection process. {選|えら}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'have chosen' or 'is choosing.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{選|えら}ぶ (choose ~)\n- 〜⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{選|えら}ぶ (choose from ~)\n- ⟦{好|す}き→好き：02355_suki⟧な⟦もの→物：02259_mono⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{選|えら}ぶ (choose what you like)\n- {選|えら}ばれる (be chosen - passive)\n\nThe passive {選|えら}ばれる is common for elections and selections.",
